{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_05_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7aca20e4c92e073da30af3ae569c891010727b9e384cdcaae49bac06a06a2216",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70eda907af0856ff6c36f4093e36efa0a122ed393299d1207b6edd028069355b",
      "text": "哎呀呀，真是座气派的寺庙喵。\n整个人肃然起敬指的就是这种感觉喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00d3a82ddbe0a73ac85015558bda5edaa7965ea35ee7c781f471365963cf8079",
      "text": "好啦……带着信件看遍了镰仓的\n风土人情，你们两个，有领悟到什么吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:086d8aacc37a82359a49615d8b569ec4089bb01f259e6f4934d599a7041e80d5",
      "text": "这个嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f8286c6d0f6c62856977e9a067a646974898d63b2f7a95ab24c31c9d9359de4a",
      "text": "从刚才开始我一直在揣摩寄信人的心意，\n但并没有自信确定这就是正确的理解。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:130b4eda1f8de9f68495f18cffd5c271c794a2bb70d0bda18c91a551d8c1b638",
      "text": "其实在下也是，\n思路越来越乱成一团了喵。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:885384eb509d0b3366a4356a63e04fd3c86f775f3bf7a85579ee1b1fae6a85e6",
      "text": "想要触碰他人的内心，\n真是一件艰难的工作喵～……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a7747923c836159610cee6c70fdd61ea2ffce3e948d5a0932adbcc8ff76a3f",
      "text": "寺庙的人告诉我，\n从这里一直往前走有一家图书馆。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:608ac810a458809ddb39960432a83611b784b41ae785fd9a565a460ec36c6332",
      "text": "听说那里收集了关于这个地区的各种资料。\n我们要不要去看看？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e56c1d1cf9364d139deb9c80683c6f7dec05416cf6f87fdf7027fe508d94c93c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー君，好主意喵！\n去那里的话，一定能找到突破口喵！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_05:1_4_002_05_e:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1644387455f58fedacd87e5b1c225a7a50ac03e1f7700a25c5f48ed4ebef84b",
      "text": "九郎君、蝴蝶先生。\n赶紧出发喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
